{"title":"Silver Kryss","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Gaunt Ogre, Werewolf, Reaver, Drowned Crewman, Pirate</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-req\"><b>Requires</b> Lvl 15 · STR 45 <span class=\"muted\">to equip</span></p>\n      <h2>Skill needed</h2><p>Wielding it takes the <a href=\"#/guide/special-attacks\"><b>Dagger</b> weapon skill</a>. <b>Archers</b> start with it. Everyone else can finish the quest <b><a href=\"#/guide/quest-the-mercy-knives\">The Mercy Knives</a></b> (Warden Maud Ferrow, level 11): free, and you keep the skill for good, or study a <b>Dagger tome</b> (1 skill point; vendors no longer sell them, so look on the Exchange).</p><p class=\"muted\">See <a href=\"#/guide/special-attacks\">Weapon skills &amp; specials</a> for how the skill levels and what it unlocks.</p>\n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"drowned-crewman\" title=\"Drowned Crewman - dropped it in 1 of 6 looted corpses (1/6)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/66d07a107491dfb54cc4.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Drowned Crewman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/6<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"reaver\" title=\"Reaver - dropped it in 1 of 17 looted corpses (1/17)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/e4f2bddfb547f2d8fdf7.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Reaver</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/17<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"pirate\" title=\"Pirate - dropped it in 1 of 24 looted corpses (1/24)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/e5726af5787255560aab.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Pirate</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/24<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-gaunt\" title=\"Gaunt Ogre - dropped it in 12 of 854 looted corpses (1/71)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/97882a8de7cbdb0222cc.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gaunt Ogre</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/71<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+1 more\">+1 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"werewolf\" title=\"Werewolf - dropped it in 1 of 3,778 looted corpses (1/3,778)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/0ebf199ce603121d6b69.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Werewolf</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3,778<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"silver-kryss\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Quality</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Quality\"><a class=\"q-chip on q-all\" href=\"#/item/silver-kryss\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip q-inferior\" href=\"#/item/silver-kryss?q=inferior\">Inferior <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-crude\" href=\"#/item/silver-kryss?q=crude\">Crude</a><a class=\"q-chip q-shoddy\" href=\"#/item/silver-kryss?q=shoddy\">Shoddy <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/silver-kryss?q=ordinary\">Ordinary <span>14</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-good\" href=\"#/item/silver-kryss?q=good\">Good</a><a class=\"q-chip q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/silver-kryss?q=excellent\">Excellent</a><a class=\"q-chip q-superior\" href=\"#/item/silver-kryss?q=superior\">Superior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/silver-kryss?q=flawless\">Flawless</a></div><div class=\"q-picker w-ench\" data-gear=\"silver-kryss\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Enchant\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip on\" data-wench=\"\">No enchant</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"destruction\">Destruction</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"burn\">Flame</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"freeze\">Freezing</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"shock\">Storm</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"corrode\">Corrosion</button></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">Quality scales this item’s own stats. Damage below is the weapon alone, before your stats and enchantments.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\" id=\"gearQTable\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Quality</th><th>Stats</th><th>This item</th><th>vs Ordinary</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"gearQRows\"><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/silver-kryss?q=inferior\" title=\"Show it at Inferior\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-inferior\" src=\"data/img/970e30091456bd9cd49e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-inferior\">Inferior</span></td><td>-30%</td><td>2.7–6.7 damage</td><td>-2 avg</td><td class=\"muted\">1 seen</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/silver-kryss?q=crude\" title=\"Show it at Crude\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-crude\" src=\"data/img/970e30091456bd9cd49e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-crude\">Crude</span></td><td>-20%</td><td>3.1–7.7 damage</td><td>-1.3 avg</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/silver-kryss?q=shoddy\" title=\"Show it at Shoddy\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-shoddy\" src=\"data/img/970e30091456bd9cd49e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-shoddy\">Shoddy</span></td><td>-10%</td><td>3.5–8.6 damage</td><td>-0.7 avg</td><td class=\"muted\">1 seen</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/silver-kryss?q=ordinary\" title=\"Show it at Ordinary\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/970e30091456bd9cd49e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">Ordinary</span></td><td>0%</td><td>3.8–9.6 damage</td><td>0 avg</td><td class=\"muted\">14 seen</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/silver-kryss?q=good\" title=\"Show it at Good\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-good\" src=\"data/img/970e30091456bd9cd49e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-good\">Good</span></td><td>+10%</td><td>4.2–10.5 damage</td><td>+0.7 avg</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/silver-kryss?q=excellent\" title=\"Show it at Excellent\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-excellent\" src=\"data/img/970e30091456bd9cd49e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-excellent\">Excellent</span></td><td>+22%</td><td>4.7–11.7 damage</td><td>+1.5 avg</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/silver-kryss?q=superior\" title=\"Show it at Superior\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-superior\" src=\"data/img/970e30091456bd9cd49e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-superior\">Superior</span></td><td>+30%</td><td>5–12.5 damage</td><td>+2 avg</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/silver-kryss?q=flawless\" title=\"Show it at Flawless\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-flawless\" src=\"data/img/970e30091456bd9cd49e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-flawless\">Flawless</span></td><td>+38%</td><td>5.3–13.2 damage</td><td>+2.5 avg</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <h2>Getting each quality</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Monster drops</b>: ordinary monsters and chests give at most Excellent; elites and bosses give Excellent or Superior. Since 27 Oct 2026 nothing drops Flawless: it is crafted only.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table\"><thead><tr><th>Dropped by</th><th>Qualities recorded</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"#/monster/ogre-gaunt\">Gaunt Ogre</a></td><td><span class=\"q-name q-shoddy\">Shoddy</span> 1 · <span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">Ordinary</span> 11</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/monster/werewolf\">Werewolf</a></td><td><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">Ordinary</span> 1</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/monster/reaver\">Reaver</a></td><td><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">Ordinary</span> 1</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/monster/drowned-crewman\">Drowned Crewman</a></td><td><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">Ordinary</span> 1</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/monster/pirate\">Pirate</a></td><td><span class=\"q-name q-inferior\">Inferior</span> 1</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"silver-kryss\">Show where it drops on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Other materials</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/iron-kryss\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/ff06530d73c8d6890e24.svg\" alt=\"\">Iron Kryss</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/gold-kryss\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/f34cb12d01760f5e9019.svg\" alt=\"\">Gold Kryss</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/titanium-kryss\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/59f833ee7c52ee8c1c91.svg\" alt=\"\">Titanium Kryss</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/970e30091456bd9cd49e.svg\" alt=\"Silver Kryss\"><span id=\"gearEnchBadge\" class=\"wp-badge\"></span></div><h3>Silver Kryss</h3><table>\n      \n      <tr><th>Damage</th><td id=\"gearDmg\">3.8–9.6 damage <span class=\"muted\">(Ordinary)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Requires</th><td>Lvl 15 · STR 45</td></tr>\n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>5 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/24/2026, 6:43:49 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}